      "id": "qa_1769778215619_u93yk2yo",
      "question": "Kaise doctor se mile",
      "answer": "KGMU mein doctor se milne ke liye, aapko pehle OPD ticket lena hoga aur phir appointment book karna hoga. Yahan kuch tareeke diye gaye hain:\n\n**OPD Ticket:**\n* OPD ticket Rs 1 mein milta hai.\n* Yeh subah 8:30 AM se 11:45 AM tak OPD registration counter se milta hai.\n\n**Appointment Book karne ke tareeke:**\n* **Online:** www.ors.gov.in par jaakar appointment book kar sakte hain.\n* **Phone se:** 0522-2258880 ya 0522-3539333 par call karein.\n* **SMS dwara:** \"APPOINTMENT <Your Name>\" likhkar 8887019134 par bhejein.\n\n**OPD Hours:**\n* OPD subah 9:00 AM se dopahar 2:00 PM tak chalti hai.\n* Sunday aur holidays ko OPD band rehti hai.\n\nAap KGMU ki website par departments ke baare mein aur adhik jaankari bhi paa sakte hain: https://www.kgmu.org/department.php",
